{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301730","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301730","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1230173001:1":{"text":"벼, 별거 아니야! 못 들은 척 해줘!","source_cn":"没、没什么，你什么也没听见！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30F2C07E2046E280","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230173002:1":{"text":"한때 나에게도 동료가 많았어. 하지만 항구가 봉쇄되고 홀로 남게 되었지.","source_cn":"我曾经有很多工友，但港口一封，如今这里只剩我一个人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40FBE132AC068C68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230173003:1":{"text":"다들 살길을 찾아야 했으니까. 나도 녀석들이랑 같이 어디 패거리에 들어갔으면 좋았을 텐데...","source_cn":"大家都各有出路。我要是和他们混，去投靠几个靠谱的帮派也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF141CDE795435566","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230173004:1":{"text":"하지만 내 성격으로는 분명 계속 고민했을 거야.","source_cn":"但我也知道，按照我的性子，我很可能会继续考虑下去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22A204E327951E4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:码头工人奇卡瓦":{"text":"부두 근로자 치카바","source":"码头工人奇卡瓦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}